        "id": 1069543
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-04-27T15:44:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I thought of that, but the existing cases I could find were in trace/events and there isn\u0027t a good alternative. Of course we could create trace/tracepoints or trace/hooks... would that be better? I didn\u0027t think this was worth creating a new directory for.\n\nWhere do you think it should go?",
      "parentUuid": "a8617670_19cf7068",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 10,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 13,
        "endChar": 3
      },
      "revId": "0efbc6e50475a746d1bd05b91c10ae57308d6d63",
