      "writtenOn": "2020-04-27T23:42:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "trace/hooks might be the right thing. There will probably be clusters of these hooks in different subsystems so there could easily be as many as 10 files.\n\nGreg- what do you recommend?\n\nFor instantiating them, are you ok with the single android/drivers/vendor_hooks.c? I don\u0027t think there\u0027s a lot of value in separating that into a bunch of files.",
      "parentUuid": "0bf92683_8221811f",
